{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"fcaa20905e646fef52638ee11406d121669ccd5d9c1cdf8154b5f6c31cc2988f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2452},"chapter":{"number":14,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["人的邪惡"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["大衛的詩，交與伶長。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"愚頑人心裏說：沒有上帝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們都是邪惡，行了可憎惡的事；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有一個人行善。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"耶和華從天上垂看世人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要看有明白的沒有，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有尋求上帝的沒有。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"他們都偏離正路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一同變為污穢；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並沒有行善的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"連一個也沒有。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"作孽的都沒有知識嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們吞吃我的百姓，如同吃飯一樣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並不求告耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"他們在那裏大大地害怕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為上帝在義人的族類中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們叫困苦人的謀算變為羞辱；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而耶和華是他的避難所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"但願以色列的救恩從錫安而出。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華救回他被擄的子民那時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各要快樂，以色列要歡喜。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/14.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/15.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/13.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}